  "notes": [
    "CT-PLO-1 (M1): squat, bench and deadlift each get one 5/3/1 exposure and one FSL-style exposure (sets x 5 at that week's first-set % of TM) on another day: bench on squat day, deadlift on bench day, squat on OHP day. The FSL-style work replaces same-day FSL (L-14).",
    "CT-PLO-1 allows a third bench exposure or a deadlift variant for the second exposure; this default keeps the competition lifts (CT-PLO-2). Swap only on request.",
    "No reduced-day layout: the rules give none for 531-2x (CT-SEL-7). A lifter with fewer than 4 days is drafted on 531-4day's layouts.",
    "CT-PLO-6: the hand-over shows each competition lift's TM beside its source set; add the meet result when there is one."
